# The older store cannot calculate its address until a three-operation RAW chain
# finishes. The younger load may first read stale Mem[16]=1. Resolving the store
# address reveals the alias, requiring recovery and a correct value of 9.
# Expected R1=7, R10=4, R11=8, R12=16; F2=9, F3=18, F4=3.
# Final memory: Mem[16]=9, Mem[20]=18, Mem[24]=3.
Integer adder   8    4       1
FP adder        4    2       1
FP multiplier   2    8       1
Load/store unit 10   1   2   1
ROB entries = 32
F1=9
Mem[16]=1, Mem[20]=2, Mem[24]=3

Addi R10 R0 4
Add R11 R10 R10
Add R12 R11 R11
Sd F1 0(R12)
Ld F2 16(R0)
Add.d F3 F2 F1
Sd F3 20(R0)
Ld F4 24(R0)
Addi R1 R0 7
